  "description": "The journey to overcoming abuse.\n\nHaram is running away from home for the third time. After struggling with life in a dormitory, she's decided to stay at a shelter for homeless adolescents. Haram is worried about living with others while managing her depression and trauma... but she's determined to find happiness.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
